OD2-dependent NF-kappa-B signaling and pro-inflammatory cytokine secretion (PubMed:16203728). Acts as a mediator of keratinocyte differentiation by sequestering SHOC2 away from ERK-activating RAS complexes (PubMed:23524970)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":["Q96RT1"]}